# Successful call site where dict has the required field
# The polymorphic get_field function should accept any dict with a "port" field
[get_port: [fn [let config] [get "port" config]]
 server: [port: 8080  host: "localhost"]
 result: [get_port server]]
=== out
["get_port": [fn [let config] ...]  "server": ["port": 8080  "host": "localhost"]  "result": 8080]
